    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's strong. I love the part about it being a 'strategic investment.' Can you expand on that? Like, how do we explain to the skeptics that this isn't just about being nice, but that it actually benefits the country sending the money too? Give me some solid points on how foreign aid directly secures our own national interests.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
