      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Foreign aid is a vital component of proactive national security, not just altruism. By supporting stable democracies and public health initiatives abroad, we directly combat the root causes of extremism and mass migration that threaten our borders. Furthermore, investing in global health prevents pandemics from becoming catastrophic national crises, safeguarding our own citizens. Ultimately, a stable, thriving world is the only environment where our own prosperity can truly flourish.",
      "source": "target",
